{"speciesId":267,"names":{"fr":"Charmillon","es":"Beautifly","en":"Beautifly","ja":"アゲハント"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"BEAUTIFLY’s favorite food is the sweet pollen of flowers. If you want to see this POKéMON, just leave a potted flower by an open window. BEAUTIFLY is sure to come looking for pollen."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"BEAUTIFLY has a long mouth like a coiled needle, which is very convenient for collecting pollen from flowers. This POKéMON rides the spring winds as it flits around gathering pollen."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its colorfully patterned wings are its most prominent feature. It flies through flower-covered fields collecting pollen. It attacks ferociously when angered."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Despite its appearance, it has an aggressive nature. It attacks by jabbing with its long, thin mouth."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Despite its appearance, it has an aggressive nature. It attacks by jabbing with its long, thin mouth."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It has an aggressive nature. It stabs prey with its long, narrow mouth to drain the prey’s fluids."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"When flower fields bloom, it flits around, collecting pollen. Despite its appearance, it is savage."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Despite its looks, it is aggressive. It jabs with its long, thin mouth if disturbed while collecting pollen."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Vibrantly patterned wings are its prominent feature. It sucks sweet flower nectar with its long mouth."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Vibrantly patterned wings are its prominent feature. It sucks sweet flower nectar with its long mouth."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Malgré les apparences, il est très agressif et attaque avec sa trompe quand on le dérange."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Despite its looks, it is aggressive. It jabs with its long, thin mouth if disturbed while collecting pollen."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Malgré les apparences, il est très agressif et attaque avec sa trompe quand on le dérange."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Despite its looks, it is aggressive. It jabs with its long, thin mouth if disturbed while collecting pollen."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Despite its looks, it is aggressive. It jabs with its long, thin mouth if disturbed while collecting pollen."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Despite its looks, it is aggressive. It jabs with its long, thin mouth if disturbed while collecting pollen."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Réputé pour les motifs de ses ailes aux couleurs vives. Il allonge sa trompe pour butiner le nectar."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Los dibujos de sus coloridas alas son muy peculiares. Liba el néctar de las flores con su fina trompa."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Vibrantly patterned wings are its prominent feature. It sucks sweet flower nectar with its long mouth."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"色 鮮やかな 羽の 模様が 特徴。 細い 口を 伸ばして 花の 甘い ミツを 吸い取る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il est très agressif. Il pique sa proie avec son long museau étroit et absorbe sa vitalité."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Es un Pokémon agresivo. Con su boca larga y afilada ataca a sus rivales para drenar sus fluidos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It has an aggressive nature. It stabs prey with its long, narrow mouth to drain the prey’s fluids."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"長細い 口を 突き刺して 相手の 体液を 吸い取る。 攻撃的な 性格。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La nourriture préférée de Charmillon est le pollen sucré des fleurs. Si on veut voir ce Pokémon, il suffit de laisser une fleur en pot sur un rebord de fenêtre. Charmillon viendra sûrement voir s’il y a du pollen."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La comida favorita de Beautifly es el dulce polen de las flores. Si quieres ver a este Pokémon, deja una maceta con flores al lado de la ventana y verás cómo aparece un ejemplar de Beautifly en busca de polen."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Beautifly’s favorite food is the sweet pollen of flowers. If you want to see this Pokémon, just leave a potted flower by an open window. Beautifly is sure to come looking for pollen."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"甘い 花粉が 大好物の ポケモン。 花を つけた 鉢植えを 窓辺に 置けば 花粉を 集めに 必ず 飛んでくるよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Charmillon a une longue trompe en spirale, particulièrement pratique pour récupérer le pollen des fleurs. Ce Pokémon se laisse porter par les vents printaniers pendant qu’il butine."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Beautifly tiene una boca enorme en espiral que parece una aguja y le resulta muy útil para recolectar polen. Este Pokémon va revoloteando de flor en flor para recogerlo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Beautifly has a long mouth like a coiled needle, which is very convenient for collecting pollen from flowers. This Pokémon rides the spring winds as it flits around gathering pollen."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"くるりと 巻いた 針の ような 長い 口は 花粉を 集める ときに とても 便利。 春風に 乗って 花粉を 集めてまわる。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"A colorful and incredibly beautiful but also greedy Pokémon. In an effort to keep its favorite food all to itself, it will chase away Combee as they try to gather nectar."}],"varieties":[{"id":267,"moves":[{"name":"gust","learns":[[5,"level-up",13],[6,"level-up",13],[7,"level-up",13],[8,"level-up",13],[9,"level-up",13],[10,"level-up",13],[11,"level-up",13],[12,"level-up",13],[13,"level-up",13],[14,"level-up",13],[15,"level-up",13],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",10],[17,"level-up",0],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",0],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"le